{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：20:45 2026-11-01 HKT<br/>發佈時間：20:45 2026-11-01 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：20:45 2026-11-01 HKT</p><img alt=\"大角咀55歲男住所走廊暈倒 獲鄰居發現 送院搶救不治\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bbab382bc10f0cfc90549e1d367fa157/2026-11/ha_kwongwah2.jpg\"/><p>大角咀褔全街一屋苑，今日（11月1日）早上近11時，一名55歲姓黎男住戶被發現於走廊暈倒，鄰居大驚報案。救護員接報到場，將男子送送往廣華醫院，可惜最終搶救無效不治。男子死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:47.250765+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":177,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T12:45:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T01:58:29.302913+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:42:02.711005+00:00","content_hash":"c94d7afa6d039e87234962bbce19a1f0c3bbf40c2dfc9ffcb1d1e4efca2f0f9f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}